														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3809099">
									

<p>Edit: author made edits</p>
<p>The <a href="http://05command.wikidot.com/wikiwalk-main">WikiWalk team</a> is proposing edits to this page. All proposed edits will be in a collapsible below this post, and after 7 days if there are no serious objections to the edits, the feedback received will be taken into account as the edits are made. If you have questions not directly related to the article about this project, please pm a member of the WikiWalk Team.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Firstly, this skip mentions the American Secure Containment Initiative. I propose crosslinking to <a href="/scp-2750">SCP-2750</a>, which embodies the ASCI pretty well.</p>
<p>Secondly, the anomalous abilities of some of these folk seem to correspond to some SCPs. I propose linking to those.</p>
<p>Editing this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>During this time the American Secure Containment Initiative had disbanded due to lack of government funding during the Civil War.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>During this time the <a href="/scp-2750">American Secure Containment Initiative</a> had disbanded due to lack of government funding during the Civil War.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Editing this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>On 6-23-1900, SCP-3155-1 was reported to have burst into flames. Intention behind this act is currently unknown.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>On 6-23-1900, SCP-3155-1 was reported to have <a href="/scp-081">burst into flames</a>. Intention behind this act is currently unknown.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Editing this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-3155 instances often have anomalous abilities primarily focusing on combat, although there have been documented cases of SCP-3155 instances controlling the Hume level within an area, effectively acting as a primitive Scrantron Reality Anchor prior to its <a href="/grant-request-for-the-manufacture-of-devices-to-regulate">creation</a> by <a href="/prometheus-labs-hub">Prometheus Labs</a> in the early 19██s. Other documented cases have shown <a href="/scp-2408">flesh manipulation</a>, psychokinetic control, and <a href="/scp-596">extreme regenerative abilities</a>.</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
